# The Network: Apple TV and News
#
# Expects Proxy, referenced with extended-matching. Must precede Platforms/Apple.list.
#
# The two Apple services whose catalog depends on where the connection comes from: the TV app with its channels and licensed streams, and News. Music and Podcasts are storefront bound rather than address bound, so they stay on the direct floor; through the proxy their playback hosts lost a third of their flows to blocked QUIC in the 14 days to 2026-09-09.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tv.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.news
DOMAIN,hls.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,hls-amt.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,hls-svod.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,np-edge.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,ocvideo.apple.com
DOMAIN,uts-api.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-assets.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-client.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-client-search.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-edge.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-events.apple.com
